Package: ensannot
Type: Package
Title: Ensembl Gene Annotation Without 'biomaRt'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Ankit", "Hinsu",
      email = "ahinsu@rvc.ac.uk",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Builds a local, reusable gene annotation table directly from
    the 'Ensembl' FTP site (core database dump files, read as plain
    tab-delimited text) for a chosen species, assembly and release, and caches
    it for reuse. The table holds Ensembl gene IDs with chromosome, start, end,
    strand, gene symbol, description, synonyms, biotype, 'Entrez' IDs and
    transcript IDs, using 'biomaRt' attribute names. It can then annotate user
    tables by Ensembl gene ID, by genomic region (all overlapping genes per
    region), or by locus (overlapping or closest genes within a given distance).
